('gate-puzzler','intermediate','What is the difference between latch and flip-flop?',ARRAY['Flip-flop is edge-triggered, latch is level-sensitive','Latch is faster','Flip-flop uses less power','No difference'],0,'Latches are transparent when enabled; FFs sample on edge.',15),
