('gate-puzzler','advanced','Implement XOR using only NAND gates. How many NAND gates are needed?',ARRAY['4','2','3','5'],0,'XOR = NAND(A,NAND(A,B)) XOR NAND(B,NAND(A,B)) — 4 NANDs.',20),
